Subject: [PATCH v7 2/3] PCI: rockchip: Simplify reset control handling by using reset_control_bulk*() function
Date: Sat, 12 Oct 2024 10:36:04 +0530
Message-ID: <20241012050611.1908-3-linux.amoon@gmail.com>
